{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 37, :comments ["<b>By the plague before YHWH.</b> By that death fitting for them — measure for measure. They sinned with the tongue, and their tongues stretched out to their navels and worms came out of their tongues and entered into their navels. Therefore it says בַּמַּגֵּפָה with a bet, and not בְמַגֵּפָה. And this is <b>before YHWH</b> — by that [death] appropriate for them according to the measures of the Holy One, blessed be He, who measures measure for measure (Sotah 35)."], :book :numbers, :voice :rashi, :lang :en, :chapter 14, :notes {}, :source-witnesses nil, :timestamp "2026-08-02T09:10:55.844463049Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}